; a morphism from a structure to itself: f: X → X.
; every tantra in avrti-refine is an endomorphism on the question graph.
; composition of endomorphisms is again an endomorphism (closure).
; iterated self-application IS avrti: f ∘ f ∘ f ∘ ... → fixpoint.

(kosha endomorphism
  (karma algebra-varga)
  (swarupa morphism)
  (abheda homomorphism)
  (sthita function category)
  (kriya composition avrti)
  (phala fixed-point convergence)
  (siddha closure associativity)
  (pratipaksha isomorphism))
